        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Václav Havel Airport Prague, Prague, Ruzyně, Czech Republic\n- Companies: Travel Service\n- Products: IATA PRG, ICAO LKPR\n- Topics: airport names, airline headquarters\n\nFacts:\n- Václav Havel Airport Prague, formerly called Prague Ruzyně International Airport, is the international airport of Prague, the capital of the Czech Republic.\n- Václav Havel Airport Prague has the IATA code PRG and the ICAO code LKPR.\n- Travel Service, a.s. is a Czech charter airline.\n- Travel Service, a.s. is the biggest airline in the Czech Republic.\n- Travel Service, a.s. has its head office on the property of Václav Havel Airport Prague in Ruzyně in Prague's 6th district.",
